  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Condition for minima is $\\mathrm{d} \\sin \\theta=\\mathrm{n} \\lambda$\nFor Ist minimad $\\sin \\theta=\\lambda$\n$\\sin \\theta=\\frac{\\lambda}{a}=\\frac{2}{4}=\\frac{1}{2} \\quad \\therefore \\theta=30^{\\circ}$\nAngular spread $=2 \\theta=60^{\\circ}$",
